WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.800
Underground, your map goes blind. Here is the same trip, guided turn by turn. Step free, from Cortlandt Street to Union Square.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.700
Go in at the glass entrance on Broadway. Turn right. The elevator is twelve steps in.

00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:17.900
Take the elevator down. Press Concourse.

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:28.100
Go forward along the passage, under the R, W, E, 1 signs. It bends right after thirty steps. Then eighty five more.

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:35.400
At the Elevator to R, W, E sign, forward forty five steps. Then turn right, to the turnstiles.

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:40.500
Go through the wide gate. Turn right. Seventeen steps to the elevators.

00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:48.800
Take the glass elevator signed Uptown and Queens, up to the platform. The one signed Downtown and Brooklyn is the wrong one.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:54.800
Board an R or W train. Ride five stops, to 14th Street, Union Square.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:04.000
At Union Square, go forward along the platform. It bears right after seventy steps. Then about a hundred and fifty steps to the elevator.

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:07.700
Take this elevator up one level, to the mezzanine.

00:01:08.700 --> 00:01:15.300
Thirteen steps forward. Turn left under the Elevator to L sign. Thirty steps, into the corridor.

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:20.700
Forward along the corridor, forty steps. Bear right. Then thirty seven more.

00:01:20.900 --> 00:01:24.900
Straight on, past the yellow columns. Twenty seven steps.

00:01:25.400 --> 00:01:30.700
Do not go out at these turnstiles. Ten steps, turn left, then fifteen steps.

00:01:30.900 --> 00:01:37.000
Through the hall with blue columns, eleven steps. Turn right. Twenty steps to the wide gate.

00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:43.800
Out through the gate, eight steps. Turn left. Twenty three steps, to the elevator by the orange mural.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:47.900
Take the elevator under the red Exit sign, up to the street.

00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:54.100
You are out, at 14th Street and 4th Avenue. The Climate Clock is across the street.

00:01:54.300 --> 00:02:00.300
If you get lost, point your camera at any sign. The app finds you, and picks the route up from there.
